  "summary_zh": "維濟米里教堂建於1834年，是冰島少數保存至今的草皮教堂，目前仍具有教區教堂功能。內部通常只在夏季特定時段開放，出發前請確認最新時間；參觀時請保持安靜、尊重禮拜活動與建築規範，非開放期間可在外部欣賞。\n\n他就在 1 號公路旁邊，路過可以經過，非常近。",
  "summary_en": "Vídimyri Turf Church, built in 1834, is one of Iceland’s few remaining turf churches and still functions as a parish church. It is usually open to visitors only during specific summer periods, so check the latest opening times before you go. When visiting, keep quiet, respect any worship activities, and follow the building’s guidelines. If the church is closed, you can still admire the exterior from the roadside. Parking is free nearby, but there are no restroom facilities on site. Plan for about 30 minutes of visiting time.",
